   48----     0.0   BEMB      Pile position w.r.t. embankment toe (positive outside)      
   49----     0.0   DPCIRC    Vertical stress under circular loaded area                  
   50----     0.0   RADIUS    Radius of circular loaded area (pile is in centre)          
   51----       0   NUMFRC    Number of vertical point forces at soil surface (max is 45) 
